sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant APP as Mobile App
  participant API as Roomspace API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  U->>APP: Create roomspace
  APP->>API: POST /api/roomspaces
  API->>DB: Insert roomspace
  API->>DB: Insert creator membership
  DB-->>API: Success
  API-->>APP: Roomspace data + code
